From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Birk Skyum <birk.skyum@pm.me>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 23:30:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: arm: qcom: Add the Lenovo ThinkCentre neo 50q QC

The Lenovo ThinkCentre neo 50q QC (machine type 13C8) is a mini PC built
on the Snapdragon X X1-26-100. Add its compatible to the X1-26-100
boards.

Signed-off-by: Birk Skyum <birk.skyum@pm.me>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
index 175ce5d..8ade73a 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
@@ -1303,6 +1303,7 @@ properties:
               - hp,omnibook-3-16-bz0
               - hp,omnibook-3-oled
               - lenovo,ideapad-slim3
+              - lenovo,thinkcentre-neo-50q-qc
           - const: qcom,x126100
           - const: qcom,x1p42100
 
-- 
